# From MyAgentKit_Keel. Project-owned: the sync never overwrites it; keep these lines.
# The hooks and scripts run through `#!/usr/bin/env sh`: a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true
# on Windows) makes that line `sh\r`, and every hook dies before its first command.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
